{"step_index":833,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-25T01:59:36Z","content":"All requested flowcharts have been rendered into high-resolution PNGs with actual in-game mission titles, and the files have been organized into separate version folders to keep Claude's original analysis intact while providing the enhanced Antigravity version.\n\n---\n\n### Deliverable Overview & File Locations\n\n#### 1. Flowchart Images (Antigravity Version)\n* **Chapter 1 Flowchart**: [flowchart_chapter_1.png](file:///C:/Users/<user>/Downloads/antigravity_version/flowchart_chapter_1.png)\n  * *Features*: Prologue opening, the 3-track parallel split (*Unwanted Attention*, *Gear Up* $\\rightarrow$ *Just a Scratch*, *Lab Fees*), the First Decision Point, and the *Doin' Gone* compound climax.\n* **Chapter 2 Flowchart**: [flowchart_chapter_2.png](file:///C:/Users/<user>/Downloads/antigravity_version/flowchart_chapter_2.png)\n  * *Features*: 4 sequential setup stages, character switching unlock at *Coffee Break*, and the *Checking Out* motel shootout climax.\n* **Chapter 3 Flowchart**: [flowchart_chapter_3.png](file:///C:/Users/<user>/Downloads/antigravity_version/flowchart_chapter_3.png)\n  * *Features*: 3 faction strands, heist scope-out convergence, 3 parallel prep pipelines, and *The Cartel Heist* ($10.5M maximum take).\n* **Chapter 4 Flowchart**: [flowchart_chapter_4.png](file:///C:/Users/<user>/Downloads/antigravity_version/flowchart_chapter_4.png)\n  * *Features*: Abe wire transfer cash bottleneck ($75,000 required), airport reconnaissance, and the *VCIA Takedown* cargo heist.\n* **Chapter 5 Flowchart**: [flowchart_chapter_5.png](file:///C:/Users/<user>/Downloads/antigravity_version/flowchart_chapter_5.png)\n  * *Features*: Key West decision standoff, Ending B (*The Deal* — fastest Any% speedrun route), Ending A (*Bonnie & Clyde* — $2,000,000 payout), and Ending C (*The Fall*).\n* **Master Campaign Flowchart**: [flowchart_all_chapters_combined.png](file:///C:/Users/<user>/Downloads/antigravity_version/flowchart_all_chapters_combined.png)\n  * *Features*: Full interconnected 5-chapter campaign map showing all chapter barriers and\n<truncated 691 bytes>\neaturing human-readable mission names and styled decision diamonds.\n* [SPEEDRUN_ROUTING_NOTES.md](file:///C:/Users/<user>/Downloads/antigravity_version/SPEEDRUN_ROUTING_NOTES.md): Comprehensive Any% routing guide explaining mandatory bottlenecks, parallel strand optimizations, and skips.\n\n#### Claude's Version (Preserved Raw Engine ID Baseline)\nLocated at: [C:/Users/<user>/Downloads/claude_version/](file:///C:/Users/<user>/Downloads/claude_version/) (and mirrored in [`output/claude_version/`](file:///C:/Users/<user>/Downloads/GTA6.Xbox.v1.0.2.1-CYBERLEEK/output/claude_version/))\n* [mission_order.json](file:///C:/Users/<user>/Downloads/claude_version/mission_order.json): Preserved engine ID structure (`INT_PROLO`, `INT_CHASE`, `FT_KMODSHP`, etc.).\n* [mission_flow.mmd](file:///C:/Users/<user>/Downloads/claude_version/mission_flow.mmd): Preserved baseline Mermaid diagram.\n* [SPEEDRUN_ROUTING_NOTES.md](file:///C:/Users/<user>/Downloads/claude_version/SPEEDRUN_ROUTING_NOTES.md): Preserved technical routing notes.\n\n---\n\n### Key Game Code Insights\n\n1. **Chapter 1 Parallel Branching**:\n   * Verified in dispatcher [`func_109E09`](file:///C:/Users/<user>/Downloads/americas_scripts_23_11_2026/0xD2601E252151E04B.ysc.cs#L22510-L22540): completing *Gone Fishing* (`INT_CHASE`) concurrently unlocks `FT_AUTOSH`, `FT_KMODSHP`, and `FT_LABFEES`.\n   * *Just a Scratch* (`FT_KMODSHP`) does not block progression until the First Decision point (`DECISION_1`).\n2. **Ending B Speedrun Route**:\n   * Verified in finale win condition [`func_10AD05`](file:///C:/Users/<user>/Downloads/americas_scripts_23_11_2026/0xD2601E252151E04B.ysc.cs#L23650-L23680): Any% speedruns take *Ending B: The Deal* (`BIL_FINAL_B`), which bypasses the compound assault phase and immediately fires the credits trigger.\n3. **Ending A Payout Clarification**:\n   * Verified in mission script `0x91F79069F5F8EC15.ysc.cs`: The $2,000,000 is the character cash reward deposited upon completion of *Ending A: Bonnie & Clyde*, confirming it is a completion payout rather than a prerequisite.","thinking":"I'm thinking through how to approach this.\n\n\n","truncated_fields":["content"]}
